      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "老吏",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "那年……水是一夜涨起来的。三尺。一夜，三尺。",
      "next": "r0448",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0448",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "谁看见的。",
      "next": "r0449",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0449",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "老吏",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "都看见了。堤上点着火把，照着水一寸一寸地吃。先吃堤脚，再吃堤面。半夜一声响，堤就没了。",
      "next": "r0450",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0450",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "然后呢。",
      "next": "r0451",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0451",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "老吏",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "然后……三千七百个。浮在麦田上头。",
      "next": "r0452",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0452",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "活下来的人呢。",
      "next": "r0453",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0453",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "老吏",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "都走了。拖家带口，逃荒。剩下的，数不出来。",
      "next": "r0455",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0455",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你说对不上账，那么这个“账”是什么？",
      "next": "r0456",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0456",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "老吏",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "归业簿。大水过后，官家要劝人归业。归业有数，赈粮才有数。我造了……六万人。",
      "next": "r0457",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0457",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "泾阳有六万人吗。",
      "next": "r0458",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0458",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "老吏",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "账上是空的。六万人……账上是空的。",
      "next": "r0459",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0459",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "空账。",
      "next": "r0460",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0460",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "老吏",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "人没了，田没了。可簿子上得有人。簿子上的人，是我一个一个添上去的。",
      "next": "r0461",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0461",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你添了假的。",
      "next": "r0462",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0462",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "老吏",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "不假。都是死的人。我把死人的名字，又写了一遍。",
      "next": "r0465",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0465",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "他睡了。",
      "next": "r0466",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0466",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "不肯说了。",
      "next": "r0467",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0467",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "殷红",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "那簿子呢。",
      "next": "r0468",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0468",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我们去抄房看一下吧。",
      "next": "end",
      "outcome": "",
